  "",
  "    // ---- the punch range (B7) ----------------------------------------------",
  "    //",
  "    // A punch is a stretch of the clip a take lands in, counted in CLIP beats and",
  "    // the same on every loop pass. The range is this device's own view state: the",
  "    // armed lane draws it as a band over the clip's beats, a drag across that",
  "    // lane sets it (whole beats), and the options row's Clear button lets it go.",
  "    // Nothing here is a command, and none of it reaches the song.",
  "",
  "    // The punch rules the page inlines before this script (panel/punch.js), or",
  "    // null on a page served without it. The comp drag has no second copy of its",
  "    // own; the punch range's own checks fall back below.",
  "    function punchRules() {",
  "      return typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.StudioPunch",
