  "",
  "    // Where the record target listens, and what it hears: the input's own name",
  "    // and channel count, the chain the operator monitors through while the take",
  "    // itself stays dry (A3's two rules), and the meter of that dry input.",
  "    function recTargetInfo(snap, lane, index) {",
