  "    }",
  "",
  "    // ---- drawing the mixer ------------------------------------------------",
  "",
  "    /**",
  "     * What each insert looked like the last time the mixer drew it. An effect whose",
  "     * kind or settings changed in the document was rebuilt by the engine, so the",
  "     * fault or the loading mark the engine reported about the old one goes with it;",
  "     * an insert the song no longer holds keeps no mark either, which is what clears",
  "     * both when it is removed (and leaves a re-added one clean).",
