  "    }",
  "",
  "    // ---- the compact strip (D3) --------------------------------------------",
  "    //",
  "    // One track's strip on its own, for the widget beside the full Mixer: the",
  "    // same level, pan, mute, solo and arm, drawn with the mixer's OWN builders",
  "    // (stripFader, stripPan, stripButtons), so the data attributes are the same",
  "    // ones the full Mixer writes and the page's delegated handlers send exactly",
  "    // the same commands. Everything it shows comes from the snapshot, so a MIDI",
  "    // controller, a recorded motion or an agent's edit moves it without a data",
  "    // path of its own; a control the operator is holding is never overwritten,",
  "    // because a render waits for the pointer to come up (view.pointerDown, as",
  "    // every other control on the page does). Arm is the page's own live state",
  "    // rather than a command: it reuses the audio track's own arm control.",
  "",
  "    function mixerStrip(track) {",
  "      var strip = { kind: 'track', owner: 'track:' + String(track.id), track: track };",
