  "",
  "    // What a chip says: the engine's own sentence for an insert it had to",
  "    // bypass, Loading while its effect is on its way, the sounds a proposal would",
  "    // play while it is still one, and otherwise the effect's own name.",
  "    function insertChipText(snap, insert) {",
  "      var id = String(insert.id);",
